   "body": "/claim cloud/m4q-reliab-opus\n\nRe-verified at `dev-swift` @ `fa96c1c1`: `ReaderWebController.contentProcessTerminated` reloads a ready document with `loadPage(document)` and nothing saved, so `documentIsReady` lands on `document.anchor` (or nowhere); `decisions(for:)` builds `ImageDecision` without `tapped:`.\n\nPlan:\n- Keep the last `.position(post:)` the ready page reported for the shown document; at a termination reload, land on it (`scroll(to:landing:)`) instead of the anchor. Positions reported while the reloaded page is not ready yet are ignored, so a top-of-page report from the fresh load cannot replace it. Cleared by `show()` of another document.\n- `decisions(for:)` passes `tapped: consented.contains(text)` (consent stays per document; `show()` already clears it).\n- Tests first (hosted): `aReloadAfterProcessTerminationLandsOnTheLastReportedPost`, plus a tapped third-party image decided `load` again.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
